        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="client_web" value="&lt;b&gt;«Client Application — Implemented»&lt;br/&gt;Web Application (React 19 Vite SPA — Port 3000)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• MF-01 Interactive Practice &amp;amp; MF-02 Timed Mock Exam&lt;br/&gt;• MF-03 Question Bank (2 Streams R8) &amp;amp; Rubric Studio 10.0&lt;br/&gt;• MF-04 Setup, Proctor (R4), Audit, One-Way Lock Publish, Appeal (R7)&lt;br/&gt;• R5 Academic Hierarchy 4 Levels &amp;amp; R6 In-Class TOTP Shifts (MF-05)&lt;br/&gt;• R2 Dead-Letter Queue Console (Admin MF-01/02 &amp;amp; Exam Officer MF-04)" style="shape=folder;fontStyle=0;tabWidth=160;tabHeight=22;tabPosition=left;html=1;boundedLbl=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="118" width="690" height="72" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="client_kiosk" value="&lt;b&gt;«Client Application — Target Design / Proposed»&lt;br/&gt;Desktop Kiosk Application (OralExamination.DesktopKiosk — Lab Workstation)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Chuyên trách duy nhất luồng Thí sinh làm bài thi thật tại phòng Lab (MF-04 Candidate Execution)&lt;br/&gt;• Kiểm tra phần cứng Mic 30s (&amp;gt;= 60 dB), Check-in ghế 1–40 &amp;amp; ip_address, Fullscreen Lockdown (blur &amp;gt; 3)&lt;br/&gt;• Thu âm STT_MSSV.webm, băm SHA-256 tại nguồn, tải trực tiếp R2 &amp;amp; nộp bài Persist-First (&amp;lt; 100ms)" style="shape=folder;fontStyle=0;tabWidth=210;tabHeight=22;tabPosition=left;html=1;boundedLbl=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#B45309;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="830" y="118" width="700" height="72" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- LAYER 1: API LAYER -->
