        <mxCell id="pkg_api_ctrl_web" value="&lt;b&gt;«sub-package» Controllers.v1 (Web Portal Only)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• PracticeController (MF-01) | MockExamsController (MF-02)&lt;br/&gt;• QuestionsController | RubricsController | ExamStructuresController (MF-03)&lt;br/&gt;• OfficialExamsController (Setup, Audit, Publish Lock, Export — MF-04 Web)&lt;br/&gt;• ProctorController (R4) | AppealsController (R7) | DeadLetterQueueController (R2)&lt;br/&gt;• AdminController | SemestersController | CoursesController | ClassesController (R5)&lt;br/&gt;• LecturerController | StudentController | NotificationsController | VerificationController&lt;br/&gt;• InClassShiftsController [Target Design / Proposed — R6]" style="shape=folder;tabWidth=140;tabHeight=20;tabPosition=left;html=1;boundedLbl=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1E40AF;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="layer_api">
