        <mxCell id="pkg_api_workers" value="&lt;b&gt;«package» API.Workers (BackgroundService)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• GradingQueueWorker (Tiêu thụ IGradingQueueChannel,&lt;br/&gt;  Polly Retry 2s-4s-8s, sinh Follow-up A2, cách ly DLQ)&lt;br/&gt;• OfficialExamGradingDispatcher &amp;amp; OfficialExamGradingWorker&lt;br/&gt;  (Tiêu thụ IOfficialExamGradingQueue, đối soát SHA-256 R2,&lt;br/&gt;  chấm CoT, gắn cờ AI Doubt Guard confidence &amp;lt; 0.70)&lt;br/&gt;• OfficialExamDlqReplayWorker (Chu kỳ 5 phút tự động chấm bù)" style="shape=folder;tabWidth=130;tabHeight=20;tabPosition=left;html=1;boundedLbl=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#15803D;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="layer_api">
