        <mxCell id="pkg_app_common" value="&lt;b&gt;«package» Application.Common (Behaviors, Models &amp;amp; DIP Interfaces)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Common.Behaviors: ValidationBehavior&amp;lt;TRequest, TResponse&amp;gt; (FluentValidation)&lt;br/&gt;• Common.Models &amp;amp; Auth: Result&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;, GradingTask, OfficialExamGradingTask, SpeechModels&lt;br/&gt;• Common.Interfaces (14 DIP Ports): IApplicationDbContext, IGradingQueueChannel,&lt;br/&gt;  IOfficialExamGradingQueue, IAiGradingService, IAiQuestionGenerationService,&lt;br/&gt;  ISpeechToTextService, ITextToSpeechService, IStorageService, IExamGradeReportExporter,&lt;br/&gt;  IAccessTokenIssuer, IGoogleIdTokenValidator, IPasswordHasher, IAntiCheatNotifier, IPracticeClient" style="shape=folder;tabWidth=160;tabHeight=20;tabPosition=left;html=1;boundedLbl=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#15803D;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="layer_app">
