        <mxCell id="pkg_app_features_2" value="&lt;b&gt;«package» Application.Features (Official Exam, Proctor, Appeal, DLQ &amp;amp; R6)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Features.OfficialExams (MF-04 Setup, Check-in ip_address, R2 Seal, Persist-First,&lt;br/&gt;  Evidence Audit, Publish One-Way Lock, Excel/PDF Export)&lt;br/&gt;• Features.Proctor (R4 Seat 1–40 Attendance &amp;amp; Anti-Cheat Log Only)&lt;br/&gt;• Features.Appeals (R7 5-Step Workflow: Student -&amp;gt; ExamOfficer -&amp;gt; DeptHead -&amp;gt; Lecturer)&lt;br/&gt;• Features.DeadLetterQueue (R2 Role-Segregated Admin vs Exam Officer Replay)&lt;br/&gt;• Features.Lecturer, Features.Student&lt;br/&gt;• Features.InClassShifts [Target Design / Proposed — R6 5-Minute Rotating TOTP]" style="shape=folder;tabWidth=160;tabHeight=20;tabPosition=left;html=1;boundedLbl=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#15803D;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="layer_app">
