        <mxCell id="pkg_dom_entities" value="&lt;b&gt;«package» Domain.Entities (38 Bảng 3NF trong 7 Bounded Contexts)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Identity (2): User, RefreshToken | Academic R5 (6): Semester, Course, CourseClo, CourseLecturer, Class, ClassEnrollment&lt;br/&gt;• Assessment (2): Rubric, RubricCriterion (Sum = 10.0) | Practice MF-01 (5): PracticeQuestion, PracticeSession, PracticeAnswer, AiEvaluation, AiEvaluationDetail&lt;br/&gt;• Mock Exam MF-02 (6): ExamStructure, ExamSet, ExamSetQuestion, MockExamQuota, MockExamSession, MockExamAnswer&lt;br/&gt;• Official Exam MF-04 (9): ExamQuestion, OfficialExamSession, RealExamSessionShift, StudentExamTicket, ExamQuestionSubmission, ExamAntiCheatLog, LecturerAudit, LecturerAuditDetail, GradingJob&lt;br/&gt;• Governance (4): AppealRequest (R7), DeadLetterQueue (R2), AuditLog, SystemConfig | In-Class R6 (4) [Target Design]: InClassExamShift, InClassShiftPassword, InClassShiftParticipant, InClassExamSubmission" style="shape=folder;tabWidth=180;tabHeight=20;tabPosition=left;html=1;boundedLbl=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B21A8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="layer_domain">
